      "craftBreakdown": {
        "setupSummary": "Establishes Tomas Reyes's grounded routine, sensory world, and the deceptive calm of a routine scratch-line assignment on Timber Creek Ridge.",
        "turnOrMisdirection": "The audience expects the hero to trust his gut effortlessly; instead, Tomas hesitates for five agonizing minutes out of pride and fear of looking foolish before choosing humility over reputation.",
        "payoffOrTag": "Transition directly to your organization's origin: ask the audience what 'blind spot' in their own industry they noticed only because they were willing to admit the old map was wrong.",
        "whyItLands": "It strips away founder arrogance by anchoring a big mission in a deeply human moment of near-failure, making the listener trust the speaker's integrity before they ever hear the pitch."
      },
