        "bridgeIn": "Think about the last time someone on a stage claimed they always knew what they were meant to build. Now picture a Tuesday morning in Duluth, Minnesota, where the thermometer on a yellow school bus reads nine below zero, and the person who actually spots the beginning of a lifelong mission isn't a founder at all\u2014he's a fifty-eight-year-old driver named Ray Castellano.",
