        "audienceVibe": "Grounded, slightly guarded, allergic to hype, and hungry for earned authenticity.",
        "bridgeIn": "Think back to what unfolded in a narrow brick storefront in Bellingham, Washington, one November Tuesday when a forty-year-old roof finally gave way.",
