        "pauseBeats": "Hold 1.5s to 2s after the first drip hits the remainder table, after the contractor's estimate, and after the customer's question in Act IV.",
        "physicalAndEyeContact": "Keep hands loose at waist height during the opening description, step one pace forward when the landlord refuses help, and hold steady eye contact across the center rows during the quiet realization.",
