        "audienceVibe": "Grounded, analytical, slightly guarded against hype, and receptive to earned humility and tactile detail.",
        "bridgeIn": "Picture a man forty feet below the surface of the Severn Estuary in November, holding a burning welding torch in water so thick with silt that he cannot see his own gloved hand.",
        "bridgeOut": "Nobody sets out to build a movement at forty feet in the dark. Sometimes an obsession begins the exact second a person decides they are tired of guessing.",
